                            <keyword start="1396928/25s" duration="4100/2500s" value="189 can i talk to you?i’m busy."/>
                            <keyword start="1396969/25s" duration="9100/2500s" value="192 wait. please. i need to apologise for earlier."/>
                            <keyword start="1397047/25s" duration="6800/2500s" value="193 yeah, you do."/>
                            <keyword start="1397107/25s" duration="7800/2500s" value="194 i’m sorry."/>
                            <keyword start="1397169/25s" duration="6600/2500s" value="195 you should be. can i go now? "/>
                            <keyword start="279447/5s" duration="10600/2500s" value="197 i’m scared, alright. you scare me."/>
                            <keyword start="1397341/25s" duration="6900/2500s" value="198 wow, i’m scary. great. thanks -"/>
                            <keyword start="1397386/25s" duration="24000/2500s" value="199 i didn’t mean-- i suck with words, okay? (confessing, uneasy) that’s probably why liv and i didn’t make it."/>
                            <keyword start="1397626/25s" duration="18200/2500s" value="200 she just ghosted me, and i let it happen cause i didn’t know what to say."/>
                            <keyword start="1397808/25s" duration="7200/2500s" value="201 so you never officially broke up? "/>
                            <keyword start="279576/5s" duration="6500/2500s" value="202 she just started avoiding me."/>
                            <keyword start="279589/5s" duration="7400/2500s" value="203 you didn’t ever try to talk to her about why?"/>
                            <keyword start="1398019/25s" duration="8s" value="204 it was dumb, i know. i figured she wanted out, and i was too much of a coward to ask why."/>
                            <keyword start="1398219/25s" duration="18400/2500s" value="205 but i don’t want to do that anymore. i like you. i always have."/>
                            <keyword start="1398403/25s" duration="7300/2500s" value="206 mackenzie holds his look. nods."/>
                            <keyword start="1398476/25s" duration="6800/2500s" value="207 but this... this is weird for me. "/>
                            <keyword start="1398544/25s" duration="4500/2500s" value="208 why?"/>
                            <keyword start="1398544/25s" duration="6400/2500s" value="209 ritchie struggles "/>
                            <keyword start="1398596/25s" duration="8400/2500s" value="210 just say the words ritchie, it’s not going to kill you."/>
                            <keyword start="279736/5s" duration="9200/2500s" value="211 ... because you’re trans."/>
                            <keyword start="1398753/25s" duration="7200/2500s" value="212  she’s crushed."/>
                            <keyword start="1398774/25s" duration="5800/2500s" value="213 i don't want it to be a problem"/>
                            <keyword start="55953s" duration="22800/2500s" value="214 this is just all new, for me. and it would be for my family too."/>
                            <keyword start="1399053/25s" duration="8900/2500s" value="215 i just had to get my head around it."/>
                            <keyword start="1399142/25s" duration="6400/2500s" value="216 why didn’t you just tell me that? "/>
                            <keyword start="1399206/25s" duration="24300/2500s" value="217 i panicked, and i shouldn’t have. because really, you being you, which is a totally rad girl,"/>
                            <keyword start="1399449/25s" duration="19800/2500s" value="218 isn’t that complicated and  all that matters is that"/>
                            <keyword start="1399647/25s" duration="15900/2500s" value="219 i seriously, seriously like you. and i don’t want to miss out."/>
                            <keyword start="1399806/25s" duration="21900/2500s" value="220 so i want you to know, i’m all in. "/>
                            <keyword start="56001s" duration="20800/2500s" value="221 and all i want to do right now is kiss you again. if you’ll let me."/>
                            <keyword start="1400233/25s" duration="9100/2500s" value="222 go on then."/>
                            <keyword start="1400324/25s" duration="9100/2500s" value="223 school corridor guys."/>
                            <keyword start="280083/5s" duration="5900/2500s" value="224 but yay for you."/>
                            <keyword start="1400474/25s" duration="9s" value="225  leaving mackenzie and ritchie smiling at each other."/>
                        </mc-clip>
