                            <keyword start="1385874/25s" duration="17600/2500s" value="204 it was dumb, i know. i figured she wanted out, and i was too much of a coward to ask why."/>
                            <keyword start="55442s" duration="20100/2500s" value="205 but i don’t want to do that anymore. i like you. i always have."/>
                            <keyword start="1386251/25s" duration="10600/2500s" value="206 mackenzie holds his look. nods."/>
                            <keyword start="1386357/25s" duration="2s" value="207 but this... this is weird for me. "/>
                            <keyword start="1386407/25s" duration="4700/2500s" value="208 why?"/>
                            <keyword start="277286/5s" duration="3400/2500s" value="209 ritchie struggles "/>
                            <keyword start="1386464/25s" duration="5800/2500s" value="210 just say the words ritchie, it’s not going to kill you."/>
                            <keyword start="1386522/25s" duration="9200/2500s" value="211 ... because you’re trans."/>
                            <keyword start="1386604/25s" duration="3700/2500s" value="212  she’s crushed."/>
                            <keyword start="1386632/25s" duration="10100/2500s" value="213 i don't want it to be a problem"/>
                            <keyword start="1386734/25s" duration="9600/2500s" value="214 this is just all new, for me. and it would be for my family too."/>
                            <keyword start="1386823/25s" duration="7000/2500s" value="215 i just had to get my head around it."/>
                            <keyword start="1386893/25s" duration="8100/2500s" value="216 why didn’t you just tell me that? "/>
                            <keyword start="1386974/25s" duration="20400/2500s" value="217 i panicked, and i shouldn’t have. because really, you being you, which is a totally rad girl,"/>
                            <keyword start="1387178/25s" duration="8s" value="218 isn’t that complicated and  all that matters is that"/>
                            <keyword start="1387381/25s" duration="20800/2500s" value="219 i seriously, seriously like you. and i don’t want to miss out."/>
                            <keyword start="1387589/25s" duration="17300/2500s" value="220 so i want you to know, i’m all in. "/>
                            <keyword start="1387762/25s" duration="18500/2500s" value="221 and all i want to do right now is kiss you again. if you’ll let me."/>
                            <keyword start="1387947/25s" duration="9200/2500s" value="222 go on then."/>
                            <keyword start="1388039/25s" duration="7600/2500s" value="223 school corridor guys."/>
                            <keyword start="277623/5s" duration="4400/2500s" value="224 but yay for you."/>
                            <keyword start="1388159/25s" duration="21100/2500s" value="225  leaving mackenzie and ritchie smiling at each other."/>
                        </mc-clip>
